## A place to keep notes

This is iceaxing's personal blog: a record of technical learning, hands-on projects, and moments from everyday life.

I collect ideas, experiments, and questions here so that small pieces of learning become a path worth revisiting.

## What you can find here

- **Technology and projects**: notes on first principles, experiments, and work in progress.
- **Everyday life**: observations from reading, journeys, and ordinary days.
- **Along the way**: passing thoughts and people met along the route.

## Take your time

Notes are organised into categories, projects, and collections. Start with a single article, or follow a project through its related notes.

The author's page introduces the person behind the site. The friends page leads to other travellers and their places on the web.
